{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23373","headline":"赠韦处士六年夏大热旱 · 白居易","name":"赠韦处士六年夏大热旱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骄阳连毒暑，动植皆枯槁。\n旱日乾密云，炎烟焦茂草。\n少壮犹困苦，况予病且老。\n脱无白栴檀，何以除热恼。\n汗巾束头鬓，羶食熏襟抱。\n始觉韦山人，休粮散发好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}